<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysian Oxygen year net up 20 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysian Oxygen year net up 20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		74.49	vs	 62.08</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)     53.8	 vs	 44.8</p>
<p>    Turnover		 349.33	vs	287.67</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  82.63	vs	 66.09</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	  0.11	vs	 nil</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	18.9	 vs	 17.9</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Malaysian Oxygen Bhd. It is a producer of industrial gases.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201 4813)</p>
</text>
